  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Elephant Conservation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen the long term conservation of elephants in and around Kasanka National Park in Zambia by increasing law enforcement and community outreach capacity. Specific activities will include operational support to one scout patrol group; purchase of one law enforcement vehicle, operational support to the human elephant conflict (HEC) mitigation program as well as expanding the elephant routes database for land use planning.</narrative>
  </description>
